  "answer": "The wind map for Belo Horizonte is open in your browser tab, centered on the city. I closed an ad popup along the way and set the privacy banner to decline targeted advertising.\n\n- **What it shows:** AccuWeather's \"Current Conditions > Wind\" map, with current wind speeds in mph as numbers on the map. It is not an animated flow map with moving streamlines, and I found no such option for Belo Horizonte.\n- **Around the city:** The nearest readings are about 7 mph to the north of Belo Horizonte and about 18 mph to the south, with 24 mph offshore near Vila Velha.\n- **At the city itself:** The city's own current conditions are SSW 8 mph, with gusts of 19 mph.\n\nTwo other tabs on that page may be useful. \"Wind Gusts\" shows gust speeds on the same map, and \"Satellite\" or \"Radar\" show the cloud and rain pattern.",
